            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/487568?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Bot-based backport to <code class=\"notranslate\">release-25.05</code>, triggered by a label in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3578204527\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/457578\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/457578/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/457578\">#457578</a>.</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Before merging, ensure that this backport is <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#changes-acceptable-for-releases\">acceptable for the release</a>.\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Even as a non-committer, if you find that it is not acceptable, leave a comment.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
